Z||000000||c m west||04-15-2001||09:27 PM||||Ventura Harbor Village and the Outlaw Pontiac Racers Association present Super Pontiac Sunday 8th Annual Warrior Roundup. A donation will be made to " Make a Wish Foundation".<P> Trophies will be awarded for the first three places in over 20 classes, with a humongous best of show and long distance awards. All entries will recieve a goodie bag and a dashy plaque. Outstanding raffle prizes, and live music provided by the PONTIAX. <P>  Bring the family and enjoy the harbor veiw, shops, the beach, and Milano's Italian Restaurant and many other fine eateries.<P><BR>   PONTIACS, PONTIACS, AND MORE PONTIACS!!!<P>Pre-registration = $15<BR>Day of show registration = $20\<P>7:00 am - 10:00am is registration<BR>10:00am to 12:00pm is voting<P>e-mail Kim for more info at KIMCUTS4U@yahoo.com<P>Last years show was a smashing success, Don't miss it this year<P>Eric - West Coast Fiero <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com</A> <BR>310-305-4111||||reg||1
