Z||000004||WKDFIRO||04-16-2001||03:09 PM||||I won't be able to go but OPRA has been one of the few "muscle car" clubs that actually enjoy having Fieros in their show. We were there for their first show and have gotten nothing but respect from these guys. <P>The second year we were there we were there were more entries in our class than any other class on the field! They were getting ready to split up the Fieros into stock and custom! Unfortunately they keep having the show on the same damn weekend as Knotts!<P>Its been a while since we have gotten any numbers out in force to some of these car shows. Im hoping that we can make our presence known once again at these Pontiac shows. Some may think that we have faded out or just gone away. <P>I want to show just how faded we are when we DOMINATE show fields the way we used to!<P>Hope everyone has a great time. Bring sunscreen!||||reg||14
Z||000005||c m west||04-16-2001||05:09 PM||||but not dominate WHILE faded =-)<P>  chris and I will be at both events - but if it comes down to being only at 1 - it WILL be Ventura - Anthony, I leave it to you to gather info and pics from the Knotts show<P>Eric - West Coast Fiero <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com</A> <BR>310-305-4111||||reg||1
